# Banner of Kinship (CR 614.12a, 613.4c). Bot1 controls two Elves and Bot2 one: the Banner enters with two fellowship
# counters, one for each of Bot1's Elves, because only creatures "you control" are counted. The Elves are 3/3, Bot2's Elf stays
# a 1/1 (the +1/+1 is for creatures you control of the chosen type), the Ornithopter is not an Elf, and a third Elf cast
# two turns later is a 3/3 at once: the static ability reads the counters, it does not remember who was counted.

